   <text>
      <body>
         <div type="letter">
                <div type="address">
                    <ab>
                        <address>  <addrLine>    <name type="geo" key="G_FRA_PARI_04">9 rue de l’Université</name>  </addrLine>  <addrLine>    <name type="geo" key="G_FRA_PARI">Paris VII</name>  </addrLine>
                        </address>
                    </ab>
                </div> <div type="mainBody">
                    <p>Tanti auguri, caro <name type="person" key="rugg87">Ruggiero</name>, a Lei ed alla Sua <rs type="person" key="frie03">sposa</rs> da noi tutti. Aspetto l’arrivo del mio (capisce?) con ogni posta. Appena ricevuto Le manderò.</p>
                    <closer>   	<salute>Ogni bene e felicità</salute>                    	<signed>
                            <name type="person" key="joyc82">James Joyce</name>
                        </signed>
                    </closer>
                </div>
                <div type="translation">
                    <ab>
                        <address>  <addrLine>    <name type="geo" key="G_FRA_PARI_04">9 rue de l’Université</name>  </addrLine>  <addrLine>    <name type="geo" key="G_FRA_PARI">Paris VII</name>  </addrLine>
                        </address>
                    </ab>
                    <p>Many good wishes, dear Ruggiero, to you and your wife from all of us. I’m awaiting the arrival of mine (do you understand?) with every post. As soon as received I’ll send it to you.</p>
                    <closer>
                        <salute>All good things and happiness </salute>
                        <signed>James Joyce</signed>
                    </closer>
                </div>
            </div>
      </body>
   </text>
